// NOTE (SigCj for DF26): what followed here was an orphaned copy of the wrapper's
// TrackControl dispatch interface - a class body whose Class header line had been
// lost, leaving a stray End_Class - plus a second declaration of
// cSigCjCom_DTrackControlEvents. Both are provided by SigCjW_GridControl.pkg.
// Of the 151 members in that block, 150 were identical to the wrapper's and the
// one exception, ComPrintReport, is ComPrintGrid there; its only caller in this
// workspace is cSigCJReportControl_Pre2200.pkg, which uses the old wrapper.



